b9CzjdJ-lcNsj9DaqoMVrayfYI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af8rNcfR2UvLZV-Wz534bB1vrnbyedvUkEPm_ZoVEeeZ2w&oe=6A297DD1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Be A Lion - Animal Fun Game", "keywords": ["AnimalGame", "ZooGame", "FunGame", "LionGame", "Sandboox"], "long_description": "Step into the paws of a mighty lion in Be A Lion, a fun and immersive VR animal simulator inspired by chaotic and interactive pet-style gameplay!\n\nExplore exciting environments, interact with objects, complete fun activities, and unleash your wild instincts as you live life as a lion. Run, jump, roar, hunt, and create hilarious chaos while discovering a world filled with surprises and interactive gameplay.\n\nWhether you want to explore freely, play around with the environment, or simply enjoy being a powerful lion in virtual reality, Be A Loin - Animal Fun Game delivers a fun and entertaining VR adventure for players of all ages.\n\nFeatures:\n\n\ud83e\udd81 Become a Lion in VR\nExperience life as a wild lion in immersive virtual reality.\n\n\ud83c\udf0d Explore Interactive Environments\nRoam around detailed areas filled with objects and surprises.\n\n\ud83c\udfae Fun & Chaotic Gameplay\nCreate mischief, interact with the world, and enjoy playful animal action.\n\n\ud83c\udfc3 Run, Jump & Roar\nUse realistic movements and controls designed for VR gameplay.\n\n\ud83c\udf56 Animal Simulator Adventure\nComplete activities, explore freely, and enjoy endless fun.\n\n\ud83d\ude02 Funny & Relaxing Experience\nPerfect for casual VR players who enjoy lighthearted simulation games.\n\nIf you love animal simulator games, fun VR adventures, or interactive experiences similar to pet simulator-style games, then Be A Lion - Animal Fun Game is the perfect VR adventure for you.", "short_description": "Live the wild life of a lion in VR! Explore, hunt, play, and cause chaos in a fun animal adventure simulator."}]}, "developer_name": "